          "name": "Lower-Division Writing",
          "name_zh": "低年级写作",
          "count": 2,
          "courses": [
            "WRITING 50",
            "WRITING 60",
            "WRITING 45",
            "HUMAN 1AS",
            "HUMAN H1AS",
            "HUMAN 1BS",
            "HUMAN H1BS",
            "HUMAN 1BES",
            "HUMAN 1CS",
            "HUMAN H1CS",
            "WRITING 30",
            "WRITING 31"
          ],
          "note": "Two courses with a minimum grade of C- (or Pass/Credit equivalent). Paths: (1) WRITING 50 + WRITING 60; (2) WRITING 45 + WRITING 60 (recommended students only); (3) Humanities Core writing component: (HUMAN 1AS or H1AS or 1BS or H1BS or 1BES) + (HUMAN 1CS or H1CS); (4) students earning B (3.0) or better in WRITING 45 or 50 may substitute WRITING 30 or 31 (creative writing) as the second course. UC Entry Level Writing must be satisfied first; continuing students may use only UCI courses for writing; lower-division writing must be completed before the seventh quarter (transfer students: within the first three quarters) or academic notice applies.",
          "note_zh": "低年级写作 2 门，C- 及以上。路径：① WRITING 50 + WRITING 60；② WRITING 45 + WRITING 60（仅推荐学生）；③ 人文核心写作部分（HUMAN 1AS/H1AS/1BS/H1BS/1BES 其中一门 + HUMAN 1CS/H1CS）；④ WRITING 45 或 50 得 B（3.0）及以上者，第二门可用 WRITING 30 或 31（创意写作）替代。须先满足 UC 入学写作要求；在读学生只能用 UCI 课程满足写作要求；低年级写作须在第 7 quarter 开始前完成（转学生为入学后 3 quarters 内），否则 academic notice。"
