      "requirements": [],
      "note": "Transfer students who complete one of the following are considered to have met the total UCI GE requirement except upper-division writing: (1) GE completed at a four-year institution (petition approved); (2) GE completed at another UC campus (official documentation); (3) GE in progress at another UC campus (petition, then complete the remainder at UCI); (4) IGETC completed at a California Community College. Cal-GETC also satisfies GE (likewise except upper-division writing), with UCI Area 7 added (equivalent to two years of high school study in the same language). Transfer students must complete lower-division writing within the first three quarters.",
      "note_zh": "以下任一情况视为满足全部 UCI 通识，高年级写作除外：① 四年制大学通识已完成（petition 批准）；② 另一 UC 校区通识已完成（官方证明）；③ 另一 UC 校区通识在读中（petition + 之后在 UCI 补完）；④ 加州社区大学完成 IGETC。Cal-GETC 同样满足通识（同样不含高年级写作），且 UCI 对 Cal-GETC 另加 Area 7（相当于高中 2 年同一外语水平）。转学生低年级写作须在入学后 3 quarters 内完成。"
